    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald is delighted to introduce to the market no. 48 The Orchard, Castletroy. A well presented 3 bed mid terraced property located in the heart of Castletroy. A fantastic opportunity for one to acquire a great starter home with so many amenities close by. No. 48 could also prove to be a great investment property with its close proximity to the University of Limerick and Plassey Technological Park. The Orchard is within walking distance to a wide range of amenities, including local primary & secondary schools, Castletroy Shopping Centre & Neighborhood Park, shops, pubs, cafes & restaurants to name but a few.\n\nAccommodation: \nEntrance hallway Tilled flooring and contemporary color pallet on walls. Guest W.C located underneath stairs.\nLiving room - Open fireplace featured at center and large bay window allowing plenty of light into the room. Double doors lead into kitchen/diner.\nKitchen/Diner Bright and spacious open plan room with contemporary kitchen units & splash tilling. Sliding doors allow access to the rear garden.\nBedrooms 2 double bedrooms and 1 single. All bedrooms are finished with a neutral color pallet on the walls, laminate flooring and containing built in wardrobes.\nBathroom - Full WHB facilities, bath with overhead shower. \n\nExternally, the property features off street parking to the front and a private rear garden. There is access to the rear garden via lane way for bins/bikes. \n\nOverall, this property comes to the market in turn key condition and ready for immediate occupation. First time buyers and investors we recommend early viewing to avoid disappointment.\n\nGFCH, BER C3, 86 sqm."
      },
